{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-common-biology-08","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"biology","number":8,"points":2,"unitId":"genetics","unitLabel":"유전학","topic":"표현형·열성·상염색체","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["genetics","gene"],"stem":"다음은 초파리에서 날개 형성에 관여하는 유전자의 돌연변이를 \n대상으로 상보성(complementation)과 30°C에서의 온도민감성을 조사한\n자료이다.\n◦w1∼w4는 30°C에서 얻은 긴 날개 돌연변이체이고, 상염색체\n열성동형접합체이다. \n◦표는 w1∼w4를 교배시키고 30°C와 25°C에서 각각 배양하여\n얻은 F1 100마리의 표현형을 나타낸 것이다.\nF1의 개체수(마리)\n교배\n30°C\n25°C\n긴 날개\n정상 날개\n긴 날개\n정상 날개\nw1 × w1\n100\n0\n100\n0\nw1 × w2\n100\n0\n0\n100\nw1 × w3\n0\n100\n0\n100\nw1 × w4\n100\n0\n100\n0\nw2 × w3\n?\n㉠\n?\n?\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. w1과 w3은 동일한 유전자에 돌연변이가 있다.\nㄴ. ㉠은 100이다.\nㄷ. w4는 날개 형성에 대한 온도민감성 돌연변이체가 아니다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040","t041","t042","t043","t044","t045"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t046"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t047"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t048"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t049"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t050"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":628,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,65.703,310.4,251.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-com